"role.insomniacsM.generalBlurb" : "Please Weave Dreams for me"
"role.insomniacs.doc" : "Insomniac is crew and appear together with the Dreamweaver.<br>After successfully trying to fall asleep, insomniac sufferers follow the Dreamweaver to win and gain killing ability.<br>If the Dreamweaver dies, insomniac sufferers wake up from their dreams and become powerless crew,and then follow the crew team to win."
