"role.outlawLeader.name" : "Leader"
"role.outlawLeader.short" : "LD"
"role.outlawLeader.blurb" : "Take the path of your ultimate demise"
"role.outlawLeader.doc" : "Leader knows other original impostors while assistant and dunner cannot know.<br>Assistant,dunner and leader knows each other.<br>If the leader dies,one following impostor will be able to kill,while another one dies together with the leader."
"options.role.outlawLeader.detail" : "Leader knows other original impostors while assistant and dunner cannot know.<br>Assistant,dunner and leader knows each other.<br>If the leader dies,one following impostor will be able to kill,while another one dies together with the leader."
