"role.assistant.short" : "AT"
"role.assistant.blurb" : "Disappear in your shadow"
"button.label.assistant.shapeshift" : "SHAPESHIFT"
"role.assistant.doc" : "Assistant appears with leader, and cannot know other original impostors.<br>If the leader dies,one following impostor will be able to kill,while another one dies together with the leader.<br>Assistant with killing ability also know other impostors.<br>You can shapeshift, after able to kill can also shapeshift."
