"role.newsAnchor.doc" : "The News-Anchor can select a player to act as an an Co-Anchor during the meeting. <br>The Co-Anchor cannot interacted action stage. <br>During the news time (when both the News-Anchor and the Co-Anchor are alive), no one can view the status of the meeting players. <br>During the news time, press the button to vote or guess the true identity of the Co-Anchor. <br>If the guess is correct, the Co-Anchor will immediately die; if incorrect, they will commit suicide. "
