"teams.violator" : "GameViolator"
"intro.violator" : "Start the game"
"role.violator.name" : "GameViolator"
"role.violator.short" : "GV"
"role.violator.blurb" : "□□□□□□"
"role.violator.doc" : "Violator is a neutral role. That only appears in special games."
"options.role.violator.detail" : "Violator is a neutral role. That only appears in special games."
"options.role.violator.Realdetail" : "When you see this, it means you have to spread panic alone in this special mode.<br>In is special mode of infection, everyone here is a crew member except for you.<br>Your winning goal is, at the only inspection meeting of the crew, <br>get the proposal not to support infectious disease testing passed or killed everyone.<br>If the inspection meeting is passed, then all the crewmates will win.<br>If they complete all the tasks, it will no one winning the game.<br>In is mode, Crewmates who actively use skills may die at any time.<br>Let this place be chaotic and achieve victory.<br><br><b>【violation of regulations】</b><br>Every time you move freely, you can change your role, but only for impostors.<br> ·You can change the num of imposters displayed during the meeting<br> ·You always can to guess incorrectly with not commit suicide.<br> ·You cannot convene diagnosis meeting."
